+CI Job Templates — examples to harden builders, test hardware, and enforce gates
+
+1) Builder job (self-hosted builder)
+
+name: Build and sign builder image
+runs-on: [self-hosted, linux, builder]
+steps:
+- uses: actions/checkout@v4
+- name: Build artifacts
+  run: |
+    ./ops/hw/ci/vendor_builder/inferentia/build_and_sign.sh || true
+- name: Publish evidence
+  uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
+  with:
+    name: builder-evidence
+    path: /workspace/artifacts/*
+
+Notes:
+- Ensure COSIGN_KMS_URI and REGISTRY secrets set.
+- Builder runner must be hardened and isolated; follow ansible sample.
+
+2) Hardware test job (self-hosted hardware runner)
+
+name: NPU & RT hardware validation
+runs-on: [self-hosted, linux, hardware]
+steps:
+- uses: actions/checkout@v4
+- name: Run NPU readiness
+  run: python3 ops/hw/validation/npu_readiness_check.py
+- name: Run HW RT sweep (single node)
+  run: |
+    NODE=${{ inputs.node }} ./ops/av/rt/vehicle_rt_validation.sh --out /tmp/rt_test || true
+- name: Upload evidence
+  uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
+  with:
+    name: hw-evidence
+    path: /tmp/rt_test*
+
+3) Promote job (CI promotion gate)
+
+name: Enforce provenance & carbon
+runs-on: [self-hosted, linux, hardware]
+steps:
+- uses: actions/checkout@v4
+- name: Verify provenance
+  env:
+    IMAGE_MANIFESTS: ${{ github.event.inputs.manifests }}
+    REKOR_SERVER: ${{ secrets.REKOR_SERVER }}
+  run: python3 ops/ci/promotion_gate/strict_provenance_enforcer.py
+- name: Carbon gate
+  env:
+    WATTTIME_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.WATTTIME_API_KEY }}
+    Aegis_CARBON_REGION: "US-CA"
+  run: python3 ops/carbon/carbon_gate_tuner.py --mode enforce --override "${{ github.event.inputs.override_artifact || '' }}"
+
+Operational notes
+- Always run carbon monitor mode for a minimum of 7–14 days before enforcing.
+- Promotion gate should run on self-hosted, audited runners.
+- Keep detailed upload of evidence artifacts for auditors.
+
