+Approval handler (stub)
+
+Purpose
+- Outline a minimal manual approval artifact workflow to allow operator-signed overrides for carbon gate or promotion.
+
+Process
+1) Platform Owner composes approval JSON:
+   python3 ops/carbon/override_signer.py --approval-id APPROVAL-123 --approved-by owner@example.com --scope '{"manifests":"deploy.yaml"}' --out /tmp/override.json
+2) Platform Owner signs with cosign (done by override_signer if COSIGN_KMS_URI set).
+3) CI promotion job should be dispatched with the override artifact path (or uploaded to shared S3) so carbon gate can verify via cosign verify.
+
+Notes
+- For automated flows, attach artifact path via workflow_dispatch input and restrict signing to Platform Owner KMS principal.
